{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create ONE Shopify section named “About – Entitled Club”.
    
    IMPORTANT:
    - This must be a SINGLE section
    - Inside this section, create MULTIPLE CONTENT BLOCKS
    - Do NOT merge blocks
    - Do NOT limit to 2 blocks
    - Create ALL blocks listed below
    
    SECTION STRUCTURE (VERY IMPORTANT)
    This section contains:
    - 1 Hero block
    - 6 Content blocks (total 7 blocks)
    
    Each Content block must have:
    - Independent background settings
    - Independent font settings
    - Independent text color settings
    - Independent image picker
    - Independent animation toggle
    
    -----------------------------------
    
    BLOCK 1 – HERO
    Block type: Hero
    
    Content:
    Headline:
    PRIVATE CLOTHING. MEMBERS ONLY.
    
    Subheading:
    Entry is granted. Releases are curated.
    
    Settings (required):
    - Background gradient (black → dark charcoal)
    - Text alignment control
    - Font family selector
    - Animation: fade-up on load
    
    -----------------------------------
    
    BLOCK 2 – CONTENT
    Title: What We Are
    Text:
    Entitled Club is a private clothing brand built on selection. We handpick menswear that meets a strict
    standard, then release it in controlled drops. We prioritise quality over quantity — so every collection
    feels exclusive by design.
    
    Layout:
    - Desktop: text left, image right
    - Mobile: stacked (text first)
    
    Settings:
    - Background gradient selector (default dark grey → soft grey)
    - Image picker
    - Font family selector
    - Hover effect toggle (image zoom)
    - Animation: fade-in (left/right)
    
    -----------------------------------
    
    BLOCK 3 – CONTENT
    Title: How Access Works
    Text:
    Access is members-only. To enter, you apply with your details. Approvals are typically granted within
    10–15 days. Once approved, you have always-on access to the storefront.
    
    Layout:
    - Desktop: image left, text right
    - Mobile: stacked
    
    Settings:
    - Background gradient selector (default soft grey → off-white)
    - Image picker
    - Font selector
    - Hover effect toggle (card lift)
    - Animation: fade-in (right/left)
    
    -----------------------------------
    
    BLOCK 4 – CONTENT
    Title: Curation Philosophy
    Text:
    We do not stock at scale. We curate. Our drops are built around scarcity that is real: few pieces, limited
    quantities, and clean selection. We keep the storefront quiet so the product stays primary.
    
    Layout:
    - Desktop: text left, image right
    
    Settings:
    - Background gradient selector (default black → graphite)
    - Image picker
    - Font selector
    - Hover effect toggle (title underline)
    - Animation: fade-up
    
    -----------------------------------
    
    BLOCK 5 – CONTENT
    Title: Authenticity & Quality
    Text:
    We source only through select authentic channels. Every piece is checked for legitimacy and overall
    quality before it is listed. We do not pass on quality rejects or defective inventory.
    
    Layout:
    - Desktop: image left, text right
    
    Settings:
    - Background gradient selector (default charcoal → mid-grey)
    - Image picker
    - Font selector
    - Hover effect toggle (image desaturate)
    - Animation: slide-in
    
    -----------------------------------
    
    BLOCK 6 – CONTENT
    Title: Drops & Archive
    Text:
    Most of our releases follow the drop model. A drop opens, members shop, and then the drop closes.
    When it closes, it becomes archive. We do not restock by default. The chapter ends.
    
    Layout:
    - Desktop: text left, image right
    
    Settings:
    - Background gradient selector (default dark steel → ash)
    - Image picker
    - Font selector
    - Hover effect toggle (text reveal)
    - Animation: staggered fade-in
    
    -----------------------------------
    
    BLOCK 7 – CONTENT
    Title: The Meaning of Entitled
    Text:
    Entitled is not arrogance. It is authority. It signals confidence, taste, and access — without noise.
    Membership is the boundary between public retail and private selection.
    
    Layout:
    - Desktop: image left, text right
    
    Settings:
    - Background gradient selector (default black → dark grey)
    - Image picker
    - Font selector
    - Hover effect toggle (title glow)
    - Animation: slow cinematic fade-up
    
    -----------------------------------
    
    GLOBAL RULES (DO NOT IGNORE)
    - No sliders
    - No carousels
    - No tabs
    - No auto-rotation
    - Clean editorial spacing
    - Quiet luxury visual tone
    , add all section image curve setting 
    also add hero section image add setting
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-about-entitled-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: {{ block.settings.hero_text_align }};
    background: {{ block.settings.hero_bg_gradient }};
    padding: 80px 20px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  {% if block.settings.hero_image %}
    .ai-about-entitled-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background-image: url('{{ block.settings.hero_image | image_url: width: 2000 }}');
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      opacity: {{ block.settings.hero_image_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }};
      z-index: 0;
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-about-entitled-hero-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    opacity: 0;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  {% if block.settings.hero_enable_animation %}
    .ai-about-entitled-hero-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}.animated {
      animation: ai-fade-up-{{ ai_gen_id }} 1.2s ease-out forwards;
    }

    @keyframes ai-fade-up-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(40px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }
  {% else %}
    .ai-about-entitled-hero-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      opacity: 1;
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-about-entitled-hero-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.hero_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.hero_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.hero_font.weight }};
    font-size: clamp(32px, 6vw, 72px);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-hero-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.hero_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.hero_font.fallback_families }};
    font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 24px);
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-block-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 100px 60px;
    position: relative;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  {% if block.settings.content_1_enable_animation or block.settings.content_2_enable_animation or block.settings.content_3_enable_animation or block.settings.content_4_enable_animation or block.settings.content_5_enable_animation or block.settings.content_6_enable_animation %}
    .ai-about-entitled-content-block-{{ ai_gen_id }}.animated {
      animation: ai-fade-in-{{ ai_gen_id }} 1s ease-out forwards;
    }

    @keyframes ai-fade-in-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
      }
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-about-entitled-content-block-{{ ai_gen_id }}.no-animation {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-block-{{ ai_gen_id }}.reverse {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 40px;
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-block-{{ ai_gen_id }}.reverse .ai-about-entitled-content-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    order: 2;
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 42px);
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: clamp(14px, 1.5vw, 18px);
    line-height: 1.7;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    margin: 0;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    min-height: 400px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-block-{{ ai_gen_id }}.reverse .ai-about-entitled-content-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    order: 1;
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    transition: transform 0.6s ease, filter 0.6s ease;
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}.curve-top-left img {
    border-radius: 60px 0 0 0;
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}.curve-top-right img {
    border-radius: 0 60px 0 0;
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}.curve-bottom-left img {
    border-radius: 0 0 0 60px;
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}.curve-bottom-right img {
    border-radius: 0 0 60px 0;
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}.curve-all img {
    border-radius: 60px;
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}.curve-top img {
    border-radius: 60px 60px 0 0;
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}.curve-bottom img {
    border-radius: 0 0 60px 60px;
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}.curve-left img {
    border-radius: 60px 0 0 60px;
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}.curve-right img {
    border-radius: 0 60px 60px 0;
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-block-{{ ai_gen_id }}.hover-image-zoom:hover .ai-about-entitled-content-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-block-{{ ai_gen_id }}.hover-card-lift {
    transition: transform 0.4s ease, box-shadow 0.4s ease, opacity 1s ease-out;
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-block-{{ ai_gen_id }}.hover-card-lift:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-block-{{ ai_gen_id }}.hover-title-underline:hover .ai-about-entitled-content-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 8px;
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-block-{{ ai_gen_id }}.hover-image-desaturate .ai-about-entitled-content-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    filter: grayscale(0);
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-block-{{ ai_gen_id }}.hover-image-desaturate:hover .ai-about-entitled-content-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    filter: grayscale(100%);
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-block-{{ ai_gen_id }}.hover-title-glow:hover .ai-about-entitled-content-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    min-height: 400px;
    background-color: #2a2a2a;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-content-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 300px;
    max-height: 300px;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-about-entitled-empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 30px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    padding: 12px 24px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    text-align: center;
    pointer-events: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .ai-about-entitled-content-block-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-about-entitled-content-block-{{ ai_gen_id }}.reverse {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: 60px 30px;
    }

    .ai-about-entitled-content-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 20px 0;
      order: 1 !important;
    }

    .ai-about-entitled-content-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      order: 2 !important;
      min-height: 300px;
    }

    .ai-about-entitled-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 60px 20px;
      min-height: 70vh;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-about-entitled-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-about-entitled-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-about-entitled-hero-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.hero_headline != blank %}
        <h1 class="ai-about-entitled-hero-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.hero_headline }}
        </h1>
      {% endif %}
      {% if block.settings.hero_subheading != blank %}
        <p class="ai-about-entitled-hero-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.hero_subheading }}
        </p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>

  {% for i in (1..6) %}
    {% liquid
      assign title_key = 'content_' | append: i | append: '_title'
      assign description_key = 'content_' | append: i | append: '_description'
      assign image_key = 'content_' | append: i | append: '_image'
      assign layout_key = 'content_' | append: i | append: '_layout'
      assign bg_key = 'content_' | append: i | append: '_bg_gradient'
      assign text_color_key = 'content_' | append: i | append: '_text_color'
      assign font_key = 'content_' | append: i | append: '_font'
      assign hover_key = 'content_' | append: i | append: '_hover_effect'
      assign animation_key = 'content_' | append: i | append: '_enable_animation'
      assign curve_key = 'content_' | append: i | append: '_image_curve'

      assign title = block.settings[title_key]
      assign description = block.settings[description_key]
      assign image = block.settings[image_key]
      assign layout = block.settings[layout_key]
      assign bg_gradient = block.settings[bg_key]
      assign text_color = block.settings[text_color_key]
      assign font = block.settings[font_key]
      assign hover_effect = block.settings[hover_key]
      assign enable_animation = block.settings[animation_key]
      assign image_curve = block.settings[curve_key]
    %}

    <div 
      class="ai-about-entitled-content-block-{{ ai_gen_id }} {% if layout == 'image_left' %}reverse{% endif %} hover-{{ hover_effect }} {% unless enable_animation %}no-animation{% endunless %}"
      style="background: {{ bg_gradient }}; color: {{ text_color }};"
      data-content-index="{{ i }}"
      data-animation="{{ enable_animation }}"
    >
      <div class="ai-about-entitled-content-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if title != blank %}
          <h2 
            class="ai-about-entitled-content-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            style="font-family: {{ font.family }}, {{ font.fallback_families }}; font-weight: {{ font.weight }};"
          >
            {{ title }}
          </h2>
        {% endif %}
        {% if description != blank %}
          <div 
            class="ai-about-entitled-content-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            style="font-family: {{ font.family }}, {{ font.fallback_families }};"
          >
            {{ description }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="ai-about-entitled-content-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} curve-{{ image_curve }}">
        {% if image %}
          <img
            src="{{ image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
            alt="{{ image.alt | escape }}"
            loading="lazy"
            width="{{ image.width }}"
            height="{{ image.height }}"
          >
        {% else %}
          <div class="ai-about-entitled-content-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
            <div class="ai-about-entitled-empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              Add an image to complete this section
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<script>
  (function() {
    const heroContent = document.querySelector('.ai-about-entitled-hero-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
    if (heroContent) {
      setTimeout(() => {
        heroContent.classList.add('animated');
      }, 100);
    }

    const contentBlocks = document.querySelectorAll('.ai-about-entitled-content-block-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
    
    contentBlocks.forEach(block => {
      const enableAnimation = block.getAttribute('data-animation') === 'true';
      
      if (enableAnimation) {
        const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
          entries.forEach(entry => {
            if (entry.isIntersecting) {
              entry.target.classList.add('animated');
              observer.unobserve(entry.target);
            }
          });
        }, {
          threshold: 0.2
        });
        
        observer.observe(block);
      }
    });
  })();
</script>

